<h1>Apply for a permit or licence</h1>
<p>Use this service to apply for building permits, business licences and parking permits, pay fees and follow your application.</p>
<ul>
    <li><a href="/Apply?kind=BuildingPermit">Building permit</a> - extensions, new buildings, alterations, demolition, signage</li>
    <li><a href="/Apply?kind=BusinessLicence">Business licence</a> - food premises, alcohol, taxis, street trading, entertainment</li>
    <li><a href="/Apply?kind=ParkingPermit">Parking permit</a> - resident, visitor, business and carer permits</li>
</ul>
<p>You sign in with your national digital identity. Businesses sign in as a representative of the organisation.</p>
